                  <li><strong>Trapdoor Demonstration:</strong> A guide demonstrates how leaves and dry soil perfectly conceal narrow underground entrances.</li>
                  <li><strong>Booby-Trap Display:</strong> Working models of punji stick traps, folding chair spikes, and tripwire snares.</li>
                  <li><strong>The Crawl Circuit:</strong> An optional 50-to-100-meter underground crawl divided into segments with exits every 20 meters.</li>
                  <li><strong>Hoang Cam Kitchen:</strong> Sampling freshly boiled cassava dipped in crushed peanuts and salt alongside hot tea.</li>
                  <li><strong>Shooting Range:</strong> An optional sports firing range featuring live-fire Soviet and American rifles.</li>
